{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2021-11-02 16:45:00', 'title': 'COMERICA INCORPORATED APPOINTS NANCY FLORES TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'DALLAS, NOV. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NANCY FLORES HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO THE COMERICA INCORPORATED BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE JAN. 1, 2022. FLORES IS CHIEF INFORMATION AND TECHNOLOGY OFFICER FOR IRVING, TEXAS-BASED MCKESSON CORPORATION, A GLOBAL LEADER IN HEALTHCARE SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS, RETAIL PHARMACY, COMMUNITY ONCOLOGY AND SPECIALTY CARE AND HEALTHCARE INFORMATION SOLUTIONS.'}